_art_preview.html
*.zip

# Generator drafts: unverified output, never canon, never committed
Reputation-Matrix2/tools/.generated/

# genkit run state: checkpoints are resumable local bookkeeping, not content
Reputation-Matrix2/tools/.genkit/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# genkit atomic-write drafts: debris from an interrupted run, never content
*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.tmp

# jsdom + deps for tools/tests render checks (installed with npm i --no-save)
node_modules/

# Contact-sheet sources: intermediate art. The sliced per-event JPEGs under
# assets/images/events/ are the real assets and ARE committed; the 2.7MB PNG
# grids they were cut from are scratch and would bloat the repo.
tools/sheets/

# Atomic-write leftovers. The existing pattern only caught genkit's
# *.N.N.tmp form, so a 6.4 MB mages-guild-code.json.tmp was committed and
# shipped to every clone. Any *.tmp is debris, never content.
*.tmp

# Location contact sheets: intermediate art. The sliced per-location JPEGs
# are the deliverable; the 3.7 MB source sheet is not.
Reputation-Matrix2/assets/images/locations/_sheets/
